<deployment-project plugin="plugin.toolbox" plugin-version="1.0">
  <configuration file="C:\LyX_Scripts\SCRIPTS_PY\INVERSA_LAPLACE\MI_ALGORITMO\root_free_laplace\root_free_laplace.prj" location="C:\LyX_Scripts\SCRIPTS_PY\INVERSA_LAPLACE\MI_ALGORITMO\root_free_laplace" name="root_free_laplace" target="target.toolbox" target-name="Package Toolbox">
    <param.appname>Root-Free Numerical Laplace Inversion Toolbox</param.appname>
    <param.authnamewatermark>Advanced Numerical Laplace Inversion Group</param.authnamewatermark>
    <param.email>support@laplace-rootfree.org</param.email>
    <param.company>Scientific Computing &amp; Numerical Analysis</param.company>
    <param.summary>High-order spectral and orthogonal inverse Laplace transforms up to K = 1,000,000 strictly without root-finding.</param.summary>
    <param.description>Root-Free Numerical Laplace Inversion Toolbox for MATLAB and GNU Octave.

Key Features:
- 100% Root-Free: Inverts high-order rational fractions without computing denominator roots, avoiding the Wilkinson ill-conditioning catastrophe.
- Taylor-Hump Elimination: Employs conformal Möbius-Laguerre orthogonal projections and Laurent-Stirling log-space recursions.
- Massive Order Support: Inverts systems from degree K = 1 up to K = 1,000,000 via FactorPoly and PartialFractions.
- Interactive Desktop Studio: Includes LaplaceGUI for dual real-time plotting, engineering presets, and CSV/Workspace data export.
- Pure MATLAB implementation compatible with R2018b through R2026+ and GNU Octave 10+.</param.description>
    <param.screenshot>${PROJECT_ROOT}\toolbox_logo.png</param.screenshot>
